        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business model is designed such that we are successful when our sellers are successful.",
        "start_character": 1206,
        "end_character": 1297
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Please see the information in “Item 1A: Risk Factors” under the captions “We face significant risk of liability for the actions of our customers, including products sold by sellers on our platforms” and “We face risk from third parties that allege that we infringe, or are responsible when our customers infringe, on their intellectual property rights.”",
        "start_character": 22662,
        "end_character": 23015
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also continue to expand our financial services offerings, including Seller Capital, which has helped our partners provide more than $1 billion in cumulative funding since inception to small businesses, along with new payment partnerships that enhance flexibility and reliability across key markets.",
        "start_character": 4888,
        "end_character": 5189
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We generate net revenues through two activities, Marketplace activities which primarily consist of commissions from the service of connecting buyers and sellers on our secure and trusted Marketplace platforms and Advertising activities, which primarily consist of fees charged to sellers to promote their listings.",
        "start_character": 11332,
        "end_character": 11646
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have used advanced technology, such as AI and Gen AI, to better anticipate the needs of buyers, sellers and developers to empower entrepreneurs and small businesses looking to grow their business and to make the Marketplace platforms more accessible to everyone.",
        "start_character": 19696,
        "end_character": 19961
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide a comprehensive suite of features and services designed to enhance the overall customer experience, leveraging innovation and trust-based programs to simplify commerce, improve efficiency and strengthen engagement and consumer confidence across our global marketplaces.",
        "start_character": 4357,
        "end_character": 4637
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a global marketplace, we thrive when diverse voices influence how we design, decide and deliver.",
        "start_character": 24336,
        "end_character": 24435
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By embedding inclusion into how we lead and operate, we foster innovation, strengthen the marketplace and create lasting value for employees, customers and shareholders.",
        "start_character": 25047,
        "end_character": 25216
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For customers, we design experiences that aim to reflect global diversity, improve discoverability, support sellers of all sizes, ensure safety and accessibility and promote the responsible use of AI.",
        "start_character": 24846,
        "end_character": 25046
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we have developed proprietary computing infrastructure, entered into strategic partnerships with leading technology providers and established a private cloud environment.",
        "start_character": 19016,
        "end_character": 19199
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In particular, we are subject to laws and regulations that affect the ecommerce industry in many countries where we operate.",
        "start_character": 13562,
        "end_character": 13686
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001065088-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001065088-26-000027-e0ea76abd544d3b7",
        "accession_number": "0001065088-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our DNA shapes how we innovate, support employees and serve millions of buyers and sellers.",
